  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "ifuse-hpca2027-traces",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tI-Fuse HPCA 2027 Traces\n\t\n\nThis dataset consolidates the final replay-ready SimPoint trace set used for\nthe HPCA 2027 I-Fuse experiments:\n\nAgentic: AppWorld, CORE-Bench, MLGym, and Terminal-Bench\nDatabase and systems: ClickHouse, DuckDB, LevelDB, Masstree, RocksDB, Silo,\nand Zstd\nGAP: BC, BFS, DFS, PageRank, and SSSP\nCRONO: APSP and TSP\n\nEach workload preserves the same bundle structure used by the original trace\nrepositories, including trace_clustering_info.json, SimPoint\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/harry1332/ifuse-hpca2027-traces.",
